<title>POLAND: STOMIL Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 15.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 15.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stomil preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			22.00 vs     22.11</p>
